{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26709","headline":"赠卢沙弥小师 · 姚合","name":"赠卢沙弥小师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怕见世间事，削头披佛衣。\n年小未受戒，会解如老师。\n天与出家肠，一食斋不饥。\n麻履踏雪路，与马不肯骑。\n嫌我身腥羶，似我见戎夷。\n彼此见会异，对面成别离。\n我师文宣王，立教垂书诗。\n但全仁义心，自然便慈悲。\n两教大体同，无处辨是非。\n莫以衣服别，到头不相知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}